#N canvas 20 20 1200 1000 12;
#X text 20 20 e_drive -- one drum track's distortion \, inside its c_voice: the sound driven by up to 40 dB into a soft clip \, a one-pole low-pass for its tone \, and mixed with the dry sound (Brendan \, 2026-11-05). ref/module/sequencer.md, f 70;
#X text 20 130 creation args: none. inlet~: the voice's sound \, at its velocity and volume. inlet: drive <0-100> \, tone <0-100> and dist <0-100> \, the mix \, from c_steps through c_kit and c_voice. outlet~: what the distortion adds to the dry sound \, mix x (driven - dry) \, which c_voice sums with the dry: at mix 100 only the driven sound is heard \, and at 0 this is off and the dry passes untouched., f 70;
#X obj 20 300 inlet~;
#X obj 600 300 inlet;
#X obj 600 340 route drive tone dist;
#X obj 20 380 *~ 0.666667;
#X obj 20 420 clip~ -1 1;
#X obj 20 460 *~;
#X obj 20 500 *~ -0.5;
#X obj 20 540 +~ 1.5;
#X obj 20 580 *~;
#X obj 20 620 lop~ 18000;
#X obj 20 660 -~;
#X obj 20 700 *~ 0;
#X obj 20 740 outlet~;
#X obj 600 400 expr pow(10 \, \$f1 / 50);
#X obj 600 440 t f f f;
#X obj 600 480 * 0.666667;
#X obj 720 520 expr -0.5 / sqrt(\$f1);
#X obj 840 480 expr 1.5 / sqrt(\$f1);
#X obj 840 340 expr 300 * pow(60 \, \$f1 / 100);
#X obj 1000 400 / 100;
#X obj 1000 440 t f f;
#X obj 1000 520 > 0;
#X obj 1000 560 change;
#X obj 1000 600 switch~;
#X text 600 680 drive is the gain into the clip \, g = 10 to the drive over 50: 1 at 0 and 100 (+40 dB) at 100. The clip is c (1.5 - 0.5 c^2) of c = 2gx/3 clipped to 1: x at low levels and drive 0 \, flattening smoothly to 1 \, cheaper on the Organelle than tanh. Its output is scaled by 1 over the root of g \, so it gets louder with the drive but not by the whole gain. tone is the low-pass's cutoff \, 300 Hz at 0 to 18 kHz at 100 \, even in octaves. Every value has its starting point in its box \, and none is set at load: c_steps tells c_kit every effect's value at load \, before this file's own loadbangs would run (ref/module/sequencer.md)., f 50;
#X text 20 800 switch~ keeps it off while the mix is 0 \, so a track with no distortion costs nothing \, and in c_voice \, which is itself off while its voice is silent \, one with it costs only while its voice sounds. A switch~ starts off., f 40;
